      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PAGE.\nWell, let it not be doubted but he’ll come,\nAnd in this shape; when you have brought him thither,\nWhat shall be done with him? What is your plot?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merry-wives-of-windsor/sceneIV_23.4/p@147385/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merry-wives-of-windsor/sceneIV_23.4/p@147385/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merry-wives-of-windsor/sceneIV_23.4/p@147385/line-3",
