      "id": "the-merry-wives-of-windsor/sceneIV_23.4/p@149596",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "EVANS.\nLet us about it. It is admirable pleasures and fery honest knaveries.",
